      <ul style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 1.25rem;">
        <li><strong>Predictable Leetspeak Substitutions:</strong> Replacing 'E' with '3' or 'A' with '@' does not fool modern cracking dictionaries because automated tools check these rule patterns immediately. True randomness is essential.</li>
        <li><strong>Password Reuse Across Multiple Sites:</strong> If one retailer suffers a credential leak, attackers immediately attempt those leaked passwords on your email and banking accounts via automated credential stuffing.</li>
